---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SITE } from "../consts";
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description={`How ${SITE.brandName} handles the information you submit through ${SITE.domain}. We collect very little and never sell personal data.`}
>
  <section class="wrap pt-16 pb-12 md:pt-24 md:pb-12">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="display mt-6 text-[clamp(2.2rem,3vw+1rem,3.5rem)]">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted">
      Last updated {SITE.legalUpdated}
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap pb-24 md:pb-32">
    <div class="wrap-narrow legal">
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy explains how {SITE.legalName} (&ldquo;we,&rdquo;
        &ldquo;us,&rdquo; or &ldquo;our&rdquo;) handles information in connection
        with our website at {SITE.domain} (the &ldquo;Site&rdquo;). We have
        designed this Site to collect as little information as possible.
      </p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>
        The Site is a static, informational website. It has no accounts and
        no logins. Apart from the contact forms described below, we collect very
        little:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Server logs.</strong> Our hosting provider automatically
          records standard technical information when your browser requests a
          page — such as your IP address, browser type, referring page, and the
          date and time of the request. This data is used to operate, secure,
          and troubleshoot the Site. We do not use it to build profiles or to
          identify you personally.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Email correspondence.</strong> If you choose to email us, we
          receive your email address and whatever information you include in
          your message. We use it only to read and respond to your inquiry.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Form submissions.</strong> If you submit one of our forms, we
          receive what you enter into it. Depending on the form, that may
          include your name, email address, phone number, details about a
          property you own, your indicated investment range, whether you have
          identified yourself as an accredited investor, how you heard about us,
          and any notes you add. You choose what to provide, and only the fields
          marked as required are necessary to submit a form.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Mailing list details.</strong> If you ask us to keep you
          posted, we receive your first and last name, email address, the role
          you selected, and your phone number if you chose to give one.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Updates by email</h2>
      <p>
        If you sign up to stay in touch, we may email you occasional updates
        about what we are buying, what we are seeing in our markets, and
        opportunities we think are relevant to the role you selected. We do not
        send on a fixed schedule, and we do not send you anything you did not
        ask for by signing up.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can stop receiving these at any time. Reply to any message, or email
        us at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>, and we will
        remove you promptly and permanently. We do not sell, rent, or share the
        list with anyone.
      </p>

      <h2>How our forms are processed</h2>
      <p>
        This Site is static and has no server of its own, so form submissions
        are delivered to us by a third-party form processor,
        <a href="https://web3forms.com" rel="noopener noreferrer">Web3Forms</a>,
        which forwards them to our email inbox. What you type into a form
        therefore passes through that provider on its way to us, and is handled
        under its own privacy policy and terms in addition to this one. Its
        servers are located in the United States.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our forms include a hidden field used to detect automated submissions.
        It is not visible to you and collects nothing about you.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you would rather not use a form, you can reach us directly at
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> or
        <a href={`tel:${SITE.phone}`}>{SITE.phoneDisplay}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>
        The Site does not set cookies, and it does not use third-party
        analytics, advertising networks, or cross-site tracking technologies.
        Fonts and other assets are served directly from the Site rather than
        loaded from third-party content networks, so simply browsing the Site
        does not share your activity with outside advertising or analytics
        services.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use information</h2>
      <p>We use the limited information described above only to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>operate, maintain, and secure the Site;</li>
        <li>respond to questions or messages you send us;</li>
        <li>
          evaluate a property you have asked us to consider, and communicate
          with you about it;
        </li>
        <li>
          contact you about investment opportunities if you have asked us to;
        </li>
        <li>
          send you the occasional updates you signed up for, until you tell us
          to stop; and
        </li>
        <li>comply with applicable legal obligations.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we share information</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell or rent personal information, and we do not share it
        with advertisers. We rely on a small number of service providers — our
        website host, our email provider, and the form processor described above
        — who process information on our behalf solely to provide those
        services. We
        may also disclose information if required to do so by law or to protect
        our rights, safety, or property.
      </p>

      <h2>Data retention</h2>
      <p>
        We keep email correspondence and form submissions only for as long as
        needed to address your inquiry and for reasonable record-keeping, after
        which they are deleted or archived. Server logs are retained by our
        hosting provider according to its standard practices, and form
        submissions are additionally subject to the retention practices of our
        form processor. Mailing list details are kept until you ask to be
        removed, after which we delete them.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
      <p>
        Depending on where you live, you may have rights to access, correct, or
        delete personal information we hold about you. Because we collect so
        little, this most commonly applies to an email you have sent us or a
        form you have submitted. To
        make a request, email us at
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> and we will respond in
        accordance with applicable law.
      </p>

      <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
      <p>
        The Site is intended for a general, professional audience and is not
        directed to children. We do not knowingly collect personal information
        from children.
      </p>

      <h2>International visitors</h2>
      <p>
        We operate the Site from the United States. If you access it from
        elsewhere, you understand that your information may be processed in the
        United States.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will
        revise the &ldquo;Last updated&rdquo; date at the top of this page.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or our privacy
        practices, contact us at
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
